{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1921091cff626b41df28bf891aed7669ee1a35a58f783310ed9db5aa18095729", "ja": "貴音、お疲れさま。新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了。新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "882eeeba9bd9d63ad25c79d49c887c13e0d43eedbfb1ea527dae8bf9088928f6", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\nくりすますという主題に合った、素晴らしい衣装かと。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我觉得这是一套非常符合圣诞主题的华丽服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "e7e31c6ba5876f9c0bfacc664eaaba7d1d941f349d39863f7430236e8be2b0ad", "ja": "ごーじゃすな装飾に包まれて、まるで私自身が、\nくりすますつりーになったかのようです。", "zh": "被华丽的装饰包围着，简直就像我自己变成了圣诞树一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "6921c92e29bd0bc241f2e2a9a9c40d1b9c46da02cf831e3daecb1bc998f92d38", "ja": "特にこの、けーぷが可愛らしく……。\nあの、{$P$}はどう思われますか？", "zh": "尤其是这件披风，真是可爱……您觉得，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1004_p", "source_sha256": "358dc3dd6829c36ea771fa1f830a75240c23935f8cb3b4de027ce51839390379", "ja": "うん、良く似合ってると思う。\n髪型も、いい感じだな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得非常适合你。\n发型也挺不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "e1fac1271442d2981e9a1dc71b58143eb05feacdfee91a327e86151f4f1ec5e2", "ja": "ふふ……そう言って頂けて、よかったです。\n衣装に合わせて結ってもらったのですが。", "zh": "呵呵……您能这么说，真是太好了。\n这是配合服装请人帮我梳的发型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "9cd3b237a795458e6036f5150be00445921d2a2b707a2949afb20cdfb9d5d180", "ja": "見た目の印象だけではなく、なにやら心持ちまで、\n変わるような……不思議ですね。", "zh": "不只是外表的印象，就连心境，\n似乎也有所改变……真是奇妙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7f418d4feb5e3b11f5497c77a78b7fec7db8e3d1e7b3de050d584cf828f92e5", "ja": "まあ、そういうものなんじゃないか？\n新鮮な気持ちになれるのは、いい事だと思うよ。", "zh": "大概就是这么回事吧？\n能带来新鲜的心情，我觉得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "c2cdd396305c3669973f34bc103329ee56c666f60486834f193a0eb132aed742", "ja": "なるほど……では、いかがでしょう？\n今からこのまま、ふたりで遊びに出かけるというのは。", "zh": "原来如此……那么，觉得怎么样？\n现在就这样，两个人一起出去玩，如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1009_p", "source_sha256": "12f0c9849ce5b6e691821dda2bcfc73cb1db3d9b818e3ab6ede405016fcd4879", "ja": "えっ？　い、いや、それは色々と問題が……。\nそれはステージ衣装だし、貴音はアイドルだから……！", "zh": "诶？不、不行，那样会有很多问题……  \n那可是舞台服装，而且贵音还是偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "84bd3a822d31bf94fa779308b2e644c9c21a64d8fd6e2d8f4ac95def219f6599", "ja": "ふふっ……冗談です。ご心配なく。", "zh": "呵呵……开个玩笑而已。不必担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eb6467200f50bace86c6a219036f840c10155fa40f69c44e39caf946aa009982", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ、うん……貴音がそんな冗談を\n言うなんて、なんだか珍しい気がするな。", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯……总觉得贵音居然会开这种玩笑，还真是少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "ae10ade7fe68b8253a6be35ce5405a89261fcf6ce4eb67cc19d309c705635da5", "ja": "これも、姿が変わったせいかもしれません。\nなぜだか、幼い日のことを思い出してしまいました。", "zh": "这或许也是因为外表发生了变化吧。  \n不知为何，我想起了儿时的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "d836918b14cd4abfecec8394e1d96177e46a8895c8391c5c622ce285e7b24d1f", "ja": "新しい服を買ってもらえると、嬉しくて……。\nこっそり、四条の家を抜け出したりしたものですから。", "zh": "只要能给我买新衣服，我就会很开心……\n因此还曾悄悄溜出过四条家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0a0dd524a42ca56a70f5adc91b9151c35e1de1f87f082d9a740d831275541d2d", "ja": "へえ、そんな事をしていたのか。", "zh": "哦，原来你以前做过这种事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "16b6a1c3f2d0720641320529314387532b26b7d93798e1b930efb18a8811c537", "ja": "ええ。じいやに黙ってこっそり遊びに行くのが、\n楽しくて……ちょっとした、いたずら心もありました。", "zh": "是的。瞒着管家偷偷跑出去玩，很开心……或许也带着一点恶作剧的心思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "f1f5cfe251d951df581e6cf88fe8bad17eca3197a0da4b91d215a27d78686f30", "ja": "子供心に、じいやの気を引きたかったのかも\nしれません。帰った時は、決まって叱られたものです。", "zh": "或许是以孩童的心思，想要引起爷爷的注意吧。\n每次回去的时候，总免不了要挨一顿训呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "03b596dcb1d418350a28d2b6ba0940d5cbf523f79c08ab5c9597eb376ea8cd2f", "ja": "ああ……あなた様の、先ほどの表情。\nその頃のじいやにそっくりだった気が……ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊……您刚才的表情，和那时的管家爷爷好像……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3691f3f0a7e70ead6bdfc8c80a8cc34f776e87c0f3b1ebd19abf1f19bfe79e90", "ja": "はは。じいやさんには、なんだか親近感を覚えるな。\nとにかく、冗談でよかった。", "zh": "哈哈。我总觉得管家爷爷让人很有亲近感呢。总之，幸好只是玩笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "bc6fbd32aac76c33a1dd5dc8ba41b22986a0808cc917c40e0cfff87882fb2891", "ja": "ふふ……ああ、ですが。ふたりで遊びに\n出かけたいというのは、冗談ではありませんよ？", "zh": "呵呵……啊，不过，我想和您两个人一起出去玩，可不是开玩笑哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "66c83c59b43c6c7d44df656780da8215b29e41aa9c37c148a2cae50c5a70f2d1", "ja": "たまには、構ってくださらないと。\nいたずらをしてしまいますよ？　……あなた様♪", "zh": "偶尔也得陪陪我才行。否则，我可要恶作剧了哦？……您呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0224_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7240408ae0abe277872b5c717618047a7d64cbf0d79339a8fe5536eb47f0b27c", "ja": "（そう言って貴音は、悪戯っぽく笑った。衣装か、\nそれとも髪型のせいか、また意外な一面が見られたな）", "zh": "（说完这些，贵音淘气地笑了起来。也不知道是服装的缘故，还是发型的缘故，又让我看到了她意外的一面。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
